{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded","id":899895,"title":"*SQUICKY* Question about Dragon Blooded...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-26T03:16:55-07:00","id":899895,"title":"*SQUICKY* Question about Dragon Blooded...","content":"Hey all.<br /> <br /> Question: I am not sure if I'm going insane, and I am sorry for the squick, but I distinctly recall a reference something like &quot;the Realm is a place where a mother may take her son to bed with her&quot; regarding the dragon blooded. I think this might have been the VERY early, pre-publishing, lore posts from back before nWoD. Did this actually make it into the books, and if so, does anyone know if the 3e Dragon Blooded are intended to be at the same level of squickiness or less?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T03:25:29-07:00","id":899897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded#post899895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey all.<br /> <br /> Question: I am not sure if I'm going insane, and I am sorry for the squick, but I distinctly recall a reference something like &quot;the Realm is a place where a mother may take her son to bed with her&quot; regarding the dragon blooded. I think this might have been the VERY early, pre-publishing, lore posts from back before nWoD. Did this actually make it into the books, and if so, does anyone know if the 3e Dragon Blooded are intended to be at the same level of squickiness or less?</div> </div> </div> </div>I Believe it was mentioned Once.. In passing in the 1st Edition. As a Rumor/Scandal thing to use before the Dragon-Blooded became Printed (When the stereotype was they were all Corrupt irredeemable Monsters/Betrayers) Mostly said to show that stereotype....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Light and Dark are two Sides of a Coin... Humanity is What Happens when it Lands on it's Edge.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3981-rickmanuk","name":"RickmanUK","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3981_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"533"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T03:42:16-07:00","id":899903,"title":"","content":"It is highly unlikely that any 3e would state something like that, I feel, at least in terms that make it seem like a common or accepted occurrence in the Realm. Neither will it likely be explicitly denied (that'd be like asking you not to think about pink elephants).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T03:48:28-07:00","id":899906,"title":"","content":"That would be about as big a scandal in the Realm as everywhere else in the world throughout history.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":24}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T04:14:49-07:00","id":899911,"title":"","content":"a dynast would likely loose less face by being caught bedding a demon","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-26T04:23:51-07:00","id":899915,"title":"","content":"Even if that demon happened to be the sort that literally steals the faces of the people it sleeps with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_