f them <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But ever since 1st edition and through 2nd edition she was always presented as a young officer of no real importance who happened to be in the right place at the right time. She was never held up as particularly powerful or important prior to seizing the Sword of Creation.<br /> <br /> So it's not like this is a change in the new edition or anything...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T14:06:51-07:00","id":905934,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded?p=905915#post905915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> But ever since 1st edition and through 2nd edition she was always presented as a young officer of no real importance who happened to be in the right place at the right time. She was never held up as particularly powerful or important prior to seizing the Sword of Creation.<br /> <br /> So it's not like this is a change in the new edition or anything...</div> </div> </div> </div>True. Most of it is Fanon. However, if I recall correctly, she figured out about the Sids almost immediately, which isn't in my mind in line with a &quot;not that powerful, but the one that survived.&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T14:09:41-07:00","id":905940,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded?p=905934#post905934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True. Most of it is Fanon. However, if I recall correctly, she figured out about the Sids almost immediately, which isn't in my mind in line with a &quot;not that powerful, but the one that survived.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I head canon that being the target of the most powerful Astrological working Creation has ever seen had some unexpected side effects. Like being resistant to Arcane Fate. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T14:16:49-07:00","id":905947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded?p=905934#post905934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">True. Most of it is Fanon. However, if I recall correctly, she figured out about the Sids almost immediately, which isn't in my mind in line with a &quot;not that powerful, but the one that survived.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>There was probably information about the Sidereal Exalted (and other Exalted) inside the manse. It wouldn't be terribly surprising. Plus it didn't hurt that within like a week after claiming the Sword, Chejop spent several days kneeling outside the Sword, got an audience and explained everything to her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T14:30:50-07:00","id":905959,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded?p=905940#post905940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I head canon that being the target of the most powerful Astrological working Creation has ever seen had some unexpected side effects. Like being resistant to Arcane Fate.</div> </div> </div> </div>My own head canon is that she never got a clue about the Sids, and her's and her friends attempt on the Imperial Manse was completely blindsided to the Sids, as the Balorean Crusade had put them &quot;outside of fate&quot;. So her ruling the most powerful DB nation is something that bugs Chejop Kejak to no end; and that a &quot;simple Dragon Blood&quot; has got herself in a position where he can't replace her.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-02T19:58:10-07:00","id":906142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/899895-squicky-question-about-dragon-blooded?p=905915#post905915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> But ever since 1st edition and through 2nd edition PCs were always presented as mortals - driven and competent, but ultimately of no real importance who happened to be in the right place at the right time. They were never held up as particularly powerful or important prior to winning Celestial Exaltation.<br /> <br /> So it's not like this is a change in the new edition or anything...</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It is the prerogative of children and halfwits to observe that the emperor is wearing no clothes. But the emperor remains an emperor, and a halfwit remains a halfwit.&quot;<br /> \\<br /> <img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b9/Dream_%28comics%29.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1024-thesaurasaurus","name":"Thesaurasaurus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"351"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}